  "about": "Describes each field in parishes.json. Blank text fields are \"\". A \"choice\" field takes one value from its list in list_options (or its own \"choices\"); a \"choices\" field can take several, separated by \"; \". A \"list\" field is free text with items separated by \"; \".",
